export const LLMS_TXT = "# MDViewer\n\n> Offline-first Markdown studio — edit, organize, preview, and optionally share via Cloudflare Workers. Private by default.\n\nMDViewer is a client-side Markdown app (Vite + React) with an optional edge share API (Hono on Cloudflare Workers + R2). Core writing stays in the browser; no account required for local use.\n\n## Docs\n\n- [Getting started](https://github.com/zamdevio/mdviewer/blob/main/docs/getting-started.md): install and run\n- [Architecture](https://github.com/zamdevio/mdviewer/blob/main/docs/architecture.md): SPA + worker layout\n- [API](https://github.com/zamdevio/mdviewer/blob/main/docs/api.md): Worker endpoints (protocol 3)\n- [Security](https://github.com/zamdevio/mdviewer/blob/main/docs/security.md): threat model and mitigations\n- [Full agent brief](https://mdviewer.zamdev.dev/llms-full.txt): endpoints, manage token vs view password, MCP\n\n## App\n\n- [Home](https://mdviewer.zamdev.dev/): product entry\n- [Editor](https://mdviewer.zamdev.dev/editor): write + live preview\n- [API docs (Swagger)](https://api.mdviewer.zamdev.dev/docs): OpenAPI UI\n- [MCP](https://api.mdviewer.zamdev.dev/mcp): JSON-RPC tools (`POST`)\n- [Source](https://github.com/zamdevio/mdviewer): GitHub\n\n## Share links\n\nUse path form only: SPA `https://mdviewer.zamdev.dev/share/<id>`, Worker raw `https://api.mdviewer.zamdev.dev/share/<id>`.\n\n## Auth (do not conflate)\n\n- **Manage token** — creator secret; required for upload / mutate / delete / rotate. Prefer `Authorization: Bearer`. Never put in the public URL.\n- **View password** — optional disposable per-share secret for GET when `viewProtected`. Header `X-Share-Password` only. Never use as admin.\n\n## Optional\n\n- [Pages deploy](https://markview.pages.dev/): Cloudflare Pages mirror\n- [Compatibility](https://api.mdviewer.zamdev.dev/compatibility): protocol 3 handshake + `ttl` / `limits`\n- [Worker llms-full](https://api.mdviewer.zamdev.dev/llms-full.txt): same brief on the API host\n";

export const LLMS_FULL_TXT = "# MDViewer — full agent brief\n\n> Protocol 3 share API + MCP on the Worker. SPA and Worker both serve `/llms.txt` / `/llms-full.txt` (SPA files are the source of truth; Worker embeds a generated copy).\n\n## Product\n\n- SPA: `apps/web` — local files/projects in browser storage, GFM + Mermaid + KaTeX preview\n- Worker: `apps/worker` — share upload/download on R2, fair-use, fixed TTL, manage token + optional view password\n- Config: public Vite defaults (`VITE_API_URL`, `VITE_FRONTEND_URL`) or Settings → Share override (http/https only). Operator caps: `apps/worker/src/lib/config.ts` (self-host edit + redeploy); SPA reads `/compatibility`.\n\n## Auth (never conflate)\n\n| Capability | Mechanism | Who |\n|------------|-----------|-----|\n| View link | Share id in URL | Anyone with the link |\n| View-protect | Optional disposable **view password** → `X-Share-Password` on GET | Readers the creator trusts |\n| Manage | **Manage token** → `Authorization: Bearer` (preferred) or `X-Share-Manage-Token` | Creator device / SPA Settings `#token` / MCP client |\n\nMutate/delete/upload/rotate **never** accept the view password as admin.\n\n## Public Worker API (protocol 3)\n\nBase: `https://api.mdviewer.zamdev.dev` (or self-hosted worker)\n\n| Method | Path | Notes |\n|--------|------|-------|\n| GET | `/health` | `{ ok: true }` |\n| GET | `/compatibility` | Handshake (`protocol: 3`); features + `ttl` + `limits` |\n| POST | `/upload` | Create; **manage token required**; optional view password + TTL headers |\n| GET | `/share/:id` | Raw markdown; view password if `viewProtected` |\n| GET | `/share/:id/meta` | Anon metadata (no hashes) |\n| PUT | `/share/:id` | Replace content; **manage token**; keeps `expiresAt` |\n| PATCH | `/share/:id` | `{ viewProtected, viewPassword? }`; **manage token** |\n| DELETE | `/share/:id` | Wipe prefix; **manage token** |\n| POST | `/share/rotate-manage` | Bulk re-key `manageTokenHash`; Bearer **old** token; body `shareIds` + `newManageToken`; cap from `limits.rotateManageMaxIds` (default 50) |\n| POST | `/mcp` | MCP JSON-RPC (`initialize`, `tools/list`, `tools/call`) |\n| GET | `/mcp` | Discovery JSON |\n| GET | `/llms.txt` | Agent brief |\n| GET | `/llms-full.txt` | This file |\n| GET | `/docs` | Swagger UI |\n| GET | `/openapi.json` | OpenAPI document |\n\nCORS / constructed frontend share URLs use worker `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` (see `apps/worker/wrangler.jsonc`). Allow `Authorization` and `X-Share-Manage-Token`.\n\nUpload / manage headers: `Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>` or `X-Share-Manage-Token`; optional view `X-Share-Password` when protect on; `X-Share-TTL-Seconds` (default 7d, max 30d); `X-Share-View-Protected`; `X-Share-Filename`; `X-Share-Type`.\n\n## MCP tools\n\n`get_share`, `get_share_meta`, `upload_share`, `update_share`, `delete_share`\n\n- `upload_share` / `update_share` / `delete_share` require **`manageToken`**\n- `get_share` uses **`viewPassword`** only when `viewProtected` (alias `password` deprecated)\n- Fair-use is stricter for MCP (`X-MDViewer-Client: mcp`)\n\n## Share URLs (same path shape everywhere)\n\n| Surface | URL | Returns |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| SPA viewer | `https://mdviewer.zamdev.dev/share/<id>` | Rendered markdown UI |\n| Worker raw | `https://api.mdviewer.zamdev.dev/share/<id>` | Plain markdown (`text/plain`) |\n| Worker meta | `https://api.mdviewer.zamdev.dev/share/<id>/meta` | JSON metadata |\n\nMCP `upload_share` returns `frontendShareUrl` (SPA) and `contentUrl` (Worker raw). Both are `/share/<id>` (no trailing slash). App routes (`/editor`, `/settings`, …) also use no trailing slash.\n\nShare viewer exposes metadata via `GET /share/:id/meta` (Details control in the SPA).\n\nIn-doc fragment links (`#heading`) work in editor preview and share viewer (first matching heading wins).\n\n## Still open (pre-v4.0)\n\n- Large-doc performance (virtual scroll / lazy heavy blocks) — `maintainer/phases/04-perf-large-docs.md`\n- Nested projects / CSP nonce / ModalShell leftovers — `maintainer/final.md` §7\n- Wipe Worker R2 before real v4 deploy (protocol 3-only objects)\n\nTrack release readiness in `maintainer/final.md`. Do **not** bump to v4.0 until that checklist is cleared and approved. Stay on **3.x.x** until then.\n\n## Security notes\n\n- Preview: rehype-sanitize after KaTeX; Mermaid `securityLevel: \"strict\"`\n- Pages: CSP, X-Frame-Options DENY, COOP\n- Manage vs view secrets: https://github.com/zamdevio/mdviewer/blob/main/docs/security.md\n\n## Links\n\n- Short brief: https://mdviewer.zamdev.dev/llms.txt\n- Repo: https://github.com/zamdevio/mdviewer\n- Phases: https://github.com/zamdevio/mdviewer/tree/main/maintainer/phases\n";
